nt-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">月</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; touch-action: pan-y; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt; background: #ffff00;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; touch-action: pan-y; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">1</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; touch-action: pan-y; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt; background: #ffff00;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; touch-action: pan-y; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">日至今）</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; touch-action: pan-y; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; touch-action: pan-y; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">或成立至今</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; touch-action: pan-y; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">（成立不足</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; touch-action: pan-y; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">一</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; touch-action: pan-y; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; touch-action: pan-y; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">年的单位）</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; touch-action: pan-y; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; touch-action: pan-y; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">财务状况无亏损或净资产大于</span> 0</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; touch-action: pan-y; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">；</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; touch-action: pan-y; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; touch-action: pan-y; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">参选单位需满足纳税信用等级</span>B<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; touch-action: pa